flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#1d2029,stroke:#555b68,color:#eceef1;
  classDef friction fill:#262a34,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:2px,color:#eceef1;
  classDef broken fill:#1d2029,stroke:#d77757,stroke-width:2px,color:#d77757;
  S1["1. The app never checks for updates (no network);<br/>a new version is found on the releases page or<br/>with brew outdated.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S2["2. brew upgrade --cask tokenpanda quits and<br/>replaces the app.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. A new ad hoc build can bring back the Open<br/>Anyway steps, and the app has no version line<br/>to confirm what runs.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S4["4. Settings, the hook, limits.json and weeks.json<br/>survive the update; Open at login keeps<br/>working.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
